      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIA SATELLITE (3) is a first starter from the Michael Lalicz kennel by Tommy Shelby out of Silver Scissors. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. HONEST TOMMY (1) showed blistering pace early and gave a sight when in the minors, beaten 4 lengths over 300m this track in 17.38. Leading player again. ROBELL RUMI (6) shows ability but remains a maiden after 24 starts. Returns to favourable course after finishing sixth (20.71) at Grafton latest. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from six starts. Has the ability to give this a shake. HAPPY ALL OVER (2) makes debut for the Jonathan Childs kennel. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Can sneak into the frame with the right run.",
